sequenceDiagram
    title Logical sequence - Chatbot message (POST /chat/conversations/:id/messages)
    participant MobileApp
    participant ChatRouter
    participant Repository
    participant AIService
    participant AIProvider
    participant Notifications
    MobileApp->>ChatRouter: citizen message
    ChatRouter->>Repository: load conversation, RLS owner only
    ChatRouter->>Repository: INSERT citizen chat_message
    ChatRouter->>AIService: chatReply with history and draft
    AIService->>Repository: read FAQ, my last 5 reports, categories
    AIService->>AIProvider: JSON prompt, redacted, 8 s timeout
    AIProvider-->>AIService: reply and action
    AIService->>AIService: validate, else rule-based fallback
    AIService-->>ChatRouter: reply, action, prediction id
    ChatRouter->>Repository: status_card built from incidents table
    ChatRouter->>Repository: draft saved to report_draft
    ChatRouter->>Repository: INSERT bot chat_message
    ChatRouter->>Notifications: on handover notify officers
    ChatRouter-->>MobileApp: 201 messages and action
